      "language": "en",
      "text": "I’m back — and I’ve finished your full analysis.\nAlong with your current situation, I also took a look at your energy field, mental state, and aura. ❤️\n\nDeep inside, you carry a powerful sensitivity and empathy that allows you to feel people more deeply than they often feel themselves. Your perspective is unique — you see life through a more spiritual and conscious lens. And because of that, you may often feel misunderstood by others, especially in relationships.\n\nWhat I’ve noticed is that you've had challenges with male energy throughout your life. You have a strong personal energy that naturally draws others in — especially men — but because of inner blocks and unconscious fears, your nervous system sometimes responds with emotional tension or conflict.\n\nRight now, I see that three major energy centers are blocked in your field:\nMuladhara, Svadhisthana, and Anahata.\nThis means there’s a weakened sense of inner stability, disconnection from your emotions and physical body, and difficulty expressing love — both toward yourself and others.\n\n🔻 Muladhara (Root Chakra) – I sense fear and pressure here, like everything in your life has to be built through struggle. You may have grown up feeling unsafe or unsupported — like things weren’t in your control. That emotional insecurity has created underlying anxiety: fear of being left, of not having support, of financial instability. Your body may constantly feel tense — especially in your legs, back, or tailbone.\n\n🟠 Svadhisthana (Sacral Chakra) – There's blocked energy here around desire and emotional connection. I see a deep suppression of your feminine expression — joy, sensuality, softness, play. At some point, you may have been judged for showing your feelings or being in your body. Since then, a protective pattern may have formed: “I’m not allowed to want,” “I can’t be soft,” “Desire is dangerous.” This can make it hard to trust in relationships, to fully open up, or to feel safe in intimacy. Past relationships may have been challenging, especially around emotional control or dependency.\n\n💚 Anahata (Heart Chakra) – This one is closed off because of emotional pain. I feel deep fatigue here — like you've opened your heart many times, waited, hoped, given love... but didn’t receive the same in return. Now, your heart says: “It’s safer not to feel than to feel pain again.” And that protective shell makes it hard to experience joy — not only in love but in life overall. When the heart is shut down, happiness becomes distant.\n\nRight now, it feels like you're living below your potential. I see a powerful light within you, but it’s dormant. Your energy is partially blocked — there’s not enough clarity or drive to move forward. You may feel lost, tired, or emotionally shut down. Like you just want to retreat from the world for a while.\n\nLast year was a heavy turning point for you — a deep reset. Things may have broken down to clear space for something new. And now you’re standing at a crossroads: either you move forward into growth, love, and recognition... or you fall back into the old cycles of pain and burnout. The choice is yours.\n\nI also sense a deep loneliness rooted in childhood. You may not have received unconditional love — the kind that simply says “you’re enough, just as you are.” Maybe your parents were emotionally distant, or maybe you had to grow up too fast. As a result, you’ve learned to ignore your own needs and just “function” — instead of being in real connection with yourself.\n\n📍I also pulled cards to look at your path for the year ahead — and here’s what came through:\n\nI see a lot of fear that’s been draining your energy and blocking your ability to fully step into your power. But I also see massive opportunities around you. There’s already someone in your energetic field — someone who’s come into your life to help you through a karmic lesson. This person is interested in you, but they’re unsure of their feelings. They may seem distant or even cold — and you might not fully notice it. But this is happening because your energy centers (the ones we talked about) are still blocked. Your feminine energy can’t fully flow — so your partner can’t feel you.\n\nBut this is a karmic partner — someone who’s meant to trigger change and help shift your life.\nThe Universe wants to give you another chance — to experience real, healthy, harmonious love. I also see that this person will likely be financially secure and bring a sense of stability.\n\nThe cards show that you’ll meet this person at a turning point. Either you’ll fall into old patterns and fears… or you’ll choose growth and pass the karmic lesson.\n\n🌟 Nothing is impossible to shift or heal. 🙏\nI’ve gone through complete breakdowns in every area of life — so I really do understand this process. I’ve lived it. And I know what works.\n\nYou were born with a rare kind of energy. Not everyone has this. It’s part of your purpose — and now is the time to activate it. This moment in your life isn’t random — it’s a spiritual crossroads. But with blocked energy centers, it’s hard to move forward or even see your path clearly.\n\nThe most important thing I see is this: you can change this.\nAnd your forecast shows that you’re meant to succeed.\n\nIf you’d like, I can share more about how we can work on clearing these blocks, unlocking your potential, and stepping into a new 7-year cycle of growth, love, and alignment. 🧡\n\nWould you like to hear more about my practices and how we can start?",
