      "text": "Hey dear ❤️ I’m back  and I’ve finished going through your situation.\nBesides just what’s going on in your life right now, I also checked the state of your energy field, your mental-emotional balance, and your aura.\n\nUnderneath it all, I feel a deep sensitivity and emotional intelligence in you. You're someone who feels people on a level that even they don't always access. You’ve got this unique way of seeing the world, more spiritual, more conscious. That’s probably why you sometimes feel misunderstood, especially in communication or romantic situations.\n\nI noticed you’ve had a recurring theme of tension in relationships with men. You’ve got strong, magnetic energy  they feel it and get drawn to you. But because of blocks and some underlying fears, your psyche can throw out defense reactions  which can show up as negative emotions or even cause conflict.\n\nRight now, I see that three of your key energy centers are blocked: Muladhara (root), Svadhisthana (sacral), and Anahata (heart). What this tells me is your inner stability is shaken, your connection with your body and emotions is blurry, and expressing love to yourself and others - feels difficult.\n\nRoot Chakra (Muladhara): I’m feeling tension and fear here - like you have to build everything in your life through struggle. In childhood or your teenage years, there may have been a sense of instability - like nothing was ever fully safe or under control. Because of that, you developed baseline anxiety: fear of being left, fear of losing security, fear of poverty. You might feel this in your body - tension in your legs, lower back, or tailbone.\n\nSacral Chakra (Svadhisthana): This one's shut down too. I’m seeing suppressed desires - especially feminine ones: joy, sensuality, connection with your body, the ability to receive. Somewhere along the line, you were made to feel like showing emotion or enjoying your body was too much or not okay. Now it’s like there’s this inner ban: I shouldn’t want, I need to be strong, pleasure is dangerous. It’s blocking trust in relationships, making intimacy feel scary. I feel the pain of past relationships - where love turned into control, dependency, or even emotional damage.\n\nHeart Chakra (Anahata): This one is closed off because of heartbreak. Your heart's tired - like it’s been open too many times, only to get hurt. I feel the hope, the love you gave — and the lack of real love in return. Now your heart is like, better to feel nothing than feel pain again. And without a working heart center, joy becomes hard to feel. Even when life is fine, you don’t feel fulfilled.\n\nYou’re not living at full power right now. Your energy feels muted. Like a fire’s burning inside, but it’s buried under heavy layers. There’s a massive potential in you - but it’s not fully awake. That’s why things feel unclear - like you’re stuck, tired, not sure what direction to go. There’s apathy. Maybe even the urge to hide from the world.\n\nThe past year has been a major transformation phase. When everything seems to break down - only so it can be rebuilt. Right now, you’re standing at a crossroads. Either you move toward growth - love, alignment, success, or repeat the past - burnout, stagnation, emotional pain. It really does depend on the choice you make now.\n\nThere’s also a deep loneliness that goes all the way back to childhood. You didn’t get the kind of love that says “You’re worthy just because you exist.” I feel a lack of warmth, emotional safety - maybe distant parents, or being forced to grow up fast. Now, you often ignore your own needs. You’re running on autopilot instead of being in real connection with yourself.\n\nYour money flow is currently at about 40 percent of your full potential. That ties back to the same blocked chakras, especially the center of power and energy flow. When this center is blocked, you’ll feel fear, doubt, anxiety, insecurity - and this whole loop of over-controlling or over-saving kicks in. That creates stagnation.\n\nThis energy blockage is also affecting your health. There may be physical symptoms from psychosomatic patterns: fatigue, migraines, tension in your neck and back. Your throat may hurt from unspoken emotions. I recommend checking your thyroid - it may be linked to suppressed feminine energy. Ask yourself where you're not showing up or speaking your truth.\n\nI also pulled cards to check your path for the next year. I see a lot of fear that drains your energy. But around you, there are major opportunities. I see someone already in your field - someone who entered your life to help you move through karmic lessons. He’s interested in you, but not sure yet how he feels. He may seem cold at times, even if you haven’t noticed it. That’s connected to the blocked feminine energy I mentioned. When your energy’s not flowing, people can’t really feel you even if you’re there.\n\nHe’s a karmic partner meant to shift your whole life. The universe is giving you another chance to find balance and stability. He may also be someone with financial abundance, which means he could help you in love or in material life as a partner, friend, or colleague. But when this person shows up fully, you’ll be at a breaking point. You’ll either go into your old fears or step into something new. And if you choose growth, you’ll pass that karmic test.\n\nNothing is impossible to shift or heal. I’ve personally been through a lot, and I know how real this is. That’s why I do this work because I’ve seen it from the inside out.\n\nYou have a rare potential in your chart not everyone has this kind of gift. It’s important to realize it and use it consciously. But with blocked chakras, that path is hard to access.\n\nThe good news is this can change. And I can see that if you act now, the outcome can be very successful. 🙏🏻\n\nIf you’re interested, I can tell you more about how to work through these blocks, activate your energy, and step into the new cycle in the right way so the next seven years are truly abundant and aligned.\n\nWant me to share the details of my practice with you?",
