      "text": "I’m back! 😊 I’ve done the diagnostic for you ❤️, and I have to say, it was such a pleasure working with you—you have such a warm and lovely energy.\n\nYou’re amazing. 😊 You’ve managed to maintain your natural beauty and charm. You know how to navigate relationships, influence people, and get what you want when you need to. You know how to take what life has to offer. But! Sometimes, this doesn’t always work out because of your emotional state and heightened anxiety.\n\nAt times, you might feel like you don’t have enough energy or strength to achieve your goals. You might experience moments of apathy or feel like it’s just around the corner.\n\nLet me start by sharing the strengths and weaknesses I identified during the diagnostic.\n\nStrengths:\nIntelligence and Charisma: You have a sharp mind and strong intellectual abilities. You handle analytical tasks easily and quickly grasp new information. You naturally attract attention and know how to present yourself well.\n\nCreative Potential: You have a vivid imagination and can come up with innovative ideas that can be applied to various areas of life.\n\nAmbition: You’re driven and determined, with a strong desire to achieve your goals. You’re motivated and persistent.\n\nCommunication Skills: You’re skilled at building connections and relationships. You’re a great communicator and can be an excellent leader or team player.\n\nWeaknesses:\nPerfectionism: You might be overly critical of yourself and others in your pursuit of perfection. This could cause you to spend too much time on details, delaying progress and distracting you from key priorities.\n\nImpatience: You might struggle with impatience when working on tasks or pursuing goals. You could lose interest if results don’t come quickly.\n\nSelf-Criticism: Being too hard on yourself can prevent you from recognizing your achievements and potential. This self-doubt might hold you back from fully realizing your abilities.\n\nPessimism: At times, you focus more on the negative aspects of situations rather than the positive. This could cause you to see obstacles instead of opportunities.\n\nObservations:\nThe past year has been transformational for you, filled with karmic lessons related to relationships and self-realization. You’re now on a path to rediscovering yourself, understanding who you are, and reviving old goals.\n\nUnfortunately, this journey has involved pain, and you may still feel nostalgic for the past. However, this is a necessary part of transformation and spiritual growth. I recommend writing down your goals and aspirations by hand, as this new cycle is opening up a path for you to ascend to a higher level of life. 🙌\n\nLooking Ahead to 2025:\nIt’s important to understand that your future for 2025 depends entirely on your actions. We shape our own futures, and only you can determine which path to take. There are both positive and negative possibilities, and it’s up to you to align with the right one.\n\nIf you enter this new cycle with courage and openness, you can make significant changes. However, if you close yourself off from new opportunities, give in to fear, or dwell on past struggles, you risk missing out. You give so much to others and radiate light, but I sense that you’re deeply sensitive. Unfortunately, your kindness isn’t always reciprocated, and some people take advantage of your resources, leaving you feeling drained.\n\nEnergy Blocks and Negative Influences:\nDuring the diagnostic, I identified a strong negative influence affecting key areas of your life. It appears to have been intentionally caused by someone skilled in spiritual practices, likely at the request of a woman you know. She seems to have deliberately targeted you to disrupt your life. You probably crossed paths with her in the past, but your paths later diverged. Around that time, significant events may have occurred that impacted your happiness and personal fulfillment.\n\nThis negative energy was specifically designed to block your happiness and relationships. You might experience fleeting moments of joy and success, but they are soon disrupted, creating a recurring cycle. Over time, this can push you deeper into emotional struggles. Partners might become distant, intuitively seeking connections elsewhere, or turn to unhealthy habits like heavy drinking, job loss, or deteriorating health.\n\nYour sexual energy—responsible for attraction, confidence, and emotional balance—is blocked, which disrupts other areas of your life. For the past two years, your channel for family happiness has been closed, leaving you feeling disconnected or lost.\n\nNext Steps:\nThis negativity urgently needs to be addressed. The sooner you resolve this, the better your chances of reclaiming your happiness. Once this blockage is cleared, everything in your personal life will change for the better. However, if left unresolved, it could lead to long-term loneliness and negatively affect your mental and physical health, as well as your beauty.\n\nIf you’re interested, I’d be happy to explain more about how we can address these challenges and restore balance to your life. The choice is, of course, yours, but I would recommend acting sooner rather than later. 😊",
      "enabled": true,
      "sortOrder": 50
